  "releaseNotes": "## [3.2.0](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.1.2...v3.2.0) (2026-10-31)\n\n### Features\n\n* **SPV3:** add FPS limit for Chimera v0.40 ([14a7651](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/14a765102b6c75eb1addfce508f17a800ce5838c)), closes [#301](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/issues/301)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **deps:** use central package version management; bump System.Text.Json to 10.0.14; bump Tmds.DBus.Protocol to 0.95.2 ([de4dd86](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/de4dd860d8d561655448fc2ca10aeab2d7ace6bb))\n* **SPV3:** disable Chimera 0.40-202 April Fools \"Gathering Exception Data\" Easter Egg by default; unsure if this also affects the \"cartridge tilt\" easter egg ([9651511](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/96515116528b423199fbd3fa892fc4170f844b0b))\n\n## [3.2.0-alpha.1](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.1.2...v3.2.0-alpha.1) (2026-10-31)\n\n### Features\n\n* **SPV3:** add FPS limit for Chimera v0.40 ([14a7651](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/14a765102b6c75eb1addfce508f17a800ce5838c)), closes [#301](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/issues/301)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **SPV3:** disable Chimera 0.40-202 April Fools \"Gathering Exception Data\" Easter Egg by default; unsure if this also affects the \"cartridge tilt\" easter egg ([9651511](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/96515116528b423199fbd3fa892fc4170f844b0b))\n\n## [3.1.2](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.1.1...v3.1.2) (2026-10-27)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* truncate nupkg release notes to 2048 characters ([ddd0e2b](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/ddd0e2b2f3bfd624e2f75e4911662244d8a246bb))\n\n## [3.1.1](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.1.0...v3.1.1) (2026-10-27)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **Common:** redirect xrandr's stdout/stderr streams; fix \"System.InvalidOperationException: StandardOut has not been redirected\" ([af6213d](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/af6213d33cde59a4dc3c41523d3ac7fd9ca561bd))\n* **Console:** limit error decorations length to terminal/console width ([6ceb6dc](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE\n\n(TRUNCATED)",
